#region Prolog
#****Begin: Generated Statements***
#****End: Generated Statements****

#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#Region # Process Summary
#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

#<Process Description>
# This process creates additional PositionIDs in the PositionID Dimension 

#<Changes Log>

# V1 - 26/10/2022 - Jithu Varghese - CPM Group - First draft

#<Maintenance Log\>

#<Execute Method>
# Daily Schedule
#<Execute Method\>

#<Processes Executed>
# syProcessLogInitialise
# syProcessLogMessage
# syTITracker
#<Processes Executed\>

#<Execute Schedule>
